# Generated code-completion maps (apps/docs, written by build:sandbox via
# @stitchapi/completions-plugin). The generator serialises with JSON.stringify
# (double quotes) and writes raw, so prettier-formatting it would flip every
# string back on the next build and leave the tree perpetually dirty. The
# `// @generated` header marks it machine-output; treat it like the other
# generated artifacts and leave it as the generator emits it.
**/*.generated.ts

